<<^ code=`&#x0002;`>>

```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "rename a local realm label and settle its folder at a quiet point"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///realm.label.renames", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/realm.label.renames"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/realm.label.renames"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! realm.label.renames ~ rename a local realm label and settle its folder at a quiet point

A rename changes a local realm pet name; the folder follows immediately when no vessel answers, or at its next lock or re-stand. The address stays a candidate until the operator reads the list.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ rename

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`rename` params=`current/notes to/Garden ~ rename a local realm label and settle its folder at a quiet point`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ current · to

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`current` params=`takes/name needs/required seat/1 as/<current> ~ the realm pet name or realm id`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`to` params=`takes/name needs/required ~ the destination realm pet name`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ local

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`local` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ the host reads or writes its local projections; this handler checks no ocap`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · realm-unnamed · realm-name-empty · realm-name-separator · realm-name-colon · realm-name-nul · realm-name-leading-dot · realm-name-collision · realm-name-face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[realm.label.renames current/notes to/Garden]] ~ name the required arguments`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`realm-unnamed` params=`cure/[[realm.label.reads]] ~ read the local labels and choose a standing realm`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`realm-name-empty` params=`cure/[[realm.label.renames current/notes to/Garden]] ~ name a realm destination`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`realm-name-separator` params=`cure/[[realm.label.renames current/notes to/Garden]] ~ choose a name without path separators`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`realm-name-colon` params=`cure/[[realm.label.renames current/notes to/Garden]] ~ choose a name without a colon`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`realm-name-nul` params=`cure/[[realm.label.renames current/notes to/Garden]] ~ choose a name without a NUL`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`realm-name-leading-dot` params=`cure/[[realm.label.renames current/notes to/Garden]] ~ choose a name without a leading dot`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`realm-name-collision` params=`cure/[[realm.label.renames current/notes to/Garden]] ~ choose a name apart from other realm names`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`realm-name-face` params=`cure/[[realm.label.renames current/notes to/Garden]] ~ choose a name apart from face names`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ rename

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`rename` params=`exit/0 fields/[[petName did from movedNow moves]] ~ the host answers the local realm rename`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares realm rename

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares realm rename]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

